571
00:20:37,140 --> 00:20:40,520
RIKO: Wow, I think most of the 
people here are here for F/ACE.

572
00:20:40,520 --> 00:20:41,850
YUINA: I'm starting to get nervous!

573
00:20:41,850 --> 00:20:44,480
UTAGE: We're finally going to learn the results.

574
00:20:44,480 --> 00:20:46,320
MC: Thank you all for waiting!

575
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:50,050
MC: The competition to decide the center 
has finally reached its conclusion!

576
00:20:50,050 --> 00:20:53,490
MC: We'll find out which member is the center 
with today's performance!

577
00:20:56,700 --> 00:20:59,410
RIKO/YUINA: Tamon-kun! You've got this!

578
00:20:59,850 --> 00:21:03,670
UTAGE: He always sparkles onstage 
and presents us with a dream...

579
00:21:04,080 --> 00:21:07,130
UTAGE: I love that Tamon-kun 
lets us escape reality.

580
00:21:07,950 --> 00:21:11,700
UTAGE: But behind that, 
exists a very real Tamon-kun...

581
00:21:13,710 --> 00:21:15,350
MC: This is F/ACE with "RAIN."

582
00:21:46,910 --> 00:21:49,340
KEITO FANS: You did it, Keito!

583
00:21:49,340 --> 00:21:51,920
OURI FANS: Why, though?!

584
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:04,650
UTAGE: The one who stresses out, 
gets depressed, fails...

585
00:22:05,570 --> 00:22:07,520
UTAGE: And cries his eyes out a lot...

586
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:10,450
RIKO: Tamon-kun didn't make it...

587
00:22:10,450 --> 00:22:12,850
YUINA: No way... This can't be real...

588
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:10,450
UTAGE: Even then, he didn't run away in the end.

589
00:22:11,220 --> 00:22:12,850
UTAGE: And now that I know that about him...

590
00:22:13,280 --> 00:22:15,240
SIGN: Tamon-kun will 
always be the center in my heart

591
00:22:16,320 --> 00:22:18,120
UTAGE: I just can't help but be 
even more devoted to him.

592
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:19,080
SIGN: Tamon-kun will always be the center in my heart

593
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:23,460
SIGN: Tamon-kun will 
always be the center in my heart

594
00:22:39,600 --> 00:22:42,100
SIGN: Tamon-kun will 
always be the center in my heart

595
00:22:56,450 --> 00:22:59,760
SIGN: Ouri Love

596
00:22:56,450 --> 00:22:59,760
SIGN: Ouri Love

597
00:22:56,450 --> 00:22:59,760
SIGN: Tamon Love

598
00:22:56,450 --> 00:22:59,760
SIGN: Tamon Love

599
00:21:34,780 --> 00:21:45,670
SONG: With raindrops soaking my shoulders

600
00:21:46,670 --> 00:21:57,000
SONG: I even forgot that I'd forgotten 
my umbrella somewhere

601
00:21:57,000 --> 00:22:00,450
SONG: Ah, the brightness shines 
on my emptiness

602
00:22:00,450 --> 00:22:03,100
SONG: Loneliness melts away my resentment

603
00:22:03,450 --> 00:22:06,370
SONG: That day I met you

604
00:22:06,370 --> 00:22:09,630
SONG: And the day we both got 
drenched in the rain

605
00:22:09,630 --> 00:22:12,850
SONG: The rain I knew—

606
00:22:12,850 --> 00:22:15,520
SONG: Was it always

607
00:22:15,520 --> 00:22:21,490
SONG: This cold?

608
00:22:21,490 --> 00:22:26,960
SONG: I realize it only now

609
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:29,170
SONG: RAIN starts falling

610
00:22:29,170 --> 00:22:32,970
SONG: Washing everything away

611
00:22:32,970 --> 00:22:38,990
SONG: Why couldn't I realize it back then?

612
00:22:38,990 --> 00:22:50,530
SONG: The sky in a morning without you—
so carelessly clear

613
00:22:50,530 --> 00:22:52,460
SONG: The RAIN won't stop

614
00:22:52,460 --> 00:22:56,450
SONG: Under the sky, I start running

615
00:22:56,450 --> 00:23:02,510
SONG: It's a new start - My days with you

616
00:23:02,510 --> 00:23:08,550
SONG: I tuck them into my heart 
and now I take a new step forward

617
00:23:08,550 --> 00:23:17,930
SONG: Thank you for being there

618
00:23:20,670 --> 00:23:26,480
SONG: RAIN—rain is falling
